  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor or oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Mix chickpeas, onion, garlic, coriander, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper in a bowl.",
    "Use your hands to shape the mixture into small falafel patties.",
    "Thread the falafel patties onto skewers, leaving a small space between each patty.",
    "Brush the falafel with olive oil and cook in the tandoor or oven for 20 minutes.",
    "Flip the skewers halfway through cooking to ensure even cooking.",
    "Serve the falafel kebabs on a slate tile vessel with a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
